{
    "title": "Coloring Brawl Stars All Skins",
    "description": "**Coloring Brawl Stars All Skins**\r\n\r\nYou will be directed to a screen with hundreds of coloring pages on the opening screen of the game.\r\n\r\nAt the top of the Brawl Stars Coloring game, you will see the names of various categories. When the game is first opened, you can see all coloring pages under the All category.\r\n\r\nCurrently, there are 5 categories in the coloring game:\r\n- Skins with over 400 brawl star skins coloring pages\r\n- Brawler with over 75 brawl star standard appearance pictures\r\n- Mixture with dozens of mixed fan art brawlers coloring pages\r\n- Fan-Art with fun and humorous brawl star character coloring pages created for you\r\n- AmongUs featuring coloring pages where brawl star characters are reimagined with Among Us appearances\r\n\r\nGet ready for an adventure that will take hours to complete over 600 brawlers coloring pages.\r\n\r\nWhen the Brawl Stars coloring game is opened, the image selected for you will be in the order of the selected category.\r\n\r\n**How to play Coloring Brawl Stars All Skins Game?**\r\n\r\nYou will encounter drawings in coloring pages that allow you to easily color almost all brawler skins from all season updates.\r\nTo start, you can select the image of the brawler character you want to color, drawn with black lines and placed on a white button.\r\n\r\nWhen the coloring page is opened, you will see a large image at the top and dozens of colors labeled with numbers at the bottom.\r\nEach color is matched with one or more coloring areas in the brawl star drawing.\r\nAfter selecting one of the colors at the bottom, you start coloring by tapping on the grayed-out areas above.\r\n\r\nSome of the brawl star character drawings may seem very detailed to you, if you can't find some areas to color on the brawler drawing, you can use the hints located in the top left corner.\r\n\r\nIf you press the Hint button, the area to be colored is zoomed in for you to easily see.\r\n\r\nWhen you run out of hints, if there is a rewarded ad that can be shown, you watch the rewarded ad, earn new hint rewards, and continue coloring where you left off.\r\nWhen you completely color a coloring page, you earn the right to use a hint as a reward.\r\n\r\nIf you want to color all the drawings in our coloring game according to the number, it means you are ready to have fun for days.\r\n\r\n**All references to \"Brawl Stars\" in the application title and description are intended solely to promote the application to potential users. It does not aim to violate any trademark.**\r\n\r\nOur application is created for Brawl Stars fans to complete coloring pages and collect pictures to the extent permitted by the fan content policy.\r\nThis material is unofficial and is not endorsed by Supercell. For more information, see Supercell's Fan Content Policy: www.supercell.com/fan-content-policy.",
    "descriptionHTML": "**Coloring Brawl Stars All Skins**<br><br>You will be directed to a screen with hundreds of coloring pages on the opening screen of the game.<br><br>At the top of the Brawl Stars Coloring game, you will see the names of various categories. When the game is first opened, you can see all coloring pages under the All category.<br><br>Currently, there are 5 categories in the coloring game:<br>- Skins with over 400 brawl star skins coloring pages<br>- Brawler with over 75 brawl star standard appearance pictures<br>- Mixture with dozens of mixed fan art brawlers coloring pages<br>- Fan-Art with fun and humorous brawl star character coloring pages created for you<br>- AmongUs featuring coloring pages where brawl star characters are reimagined with Among Us appearances<br><br>Get ready for an adventure that will take hours to complete over 600 brawlers coloring pages.<br><br>When the Brawl Stars coloring game is opened, the image selected for you will be in the order of the selected category.<br><br>**How to play Coloring Brawl Stars All Skins Game?**<br><br>You will encounter drawings in coloring pages that allow you to easily color almost all brawler skins from all season updates.<br>To start, you can select the image of the brawler character you want to color, drawn with black lines and placed on a white button.<br><br>When the coloring page is opened, you will see a large image at the top and dozens of colors labeled with numbers at the bottom.<br>Each color is matched with one or more coloring areas in the brawl star drawing.<br>After selecting one of the colors at the bottom, you start coloring by tapping on the grayed-out areas above.<br><br>Some of the brawl star character drawings may seem very detailed to you, if you can&#39;t find some areas to color on the brawler drawing, you can use the hints located in the top left corner.<br><br>If you press the Hint button, the area to be colored is zoomed in for you to easily see.<br><br>When you run out of hints, if there is a rewarded ad that can be shown, you watch the rewarded ad, earn new hint rewards, and continue coloring where you left off.<br>When you completely color a coloring page, you earn the right to use a hint as a reward.<br><br>If you want to color all the drawings in our coloring game according to the number, it means you are ready to have fun for days.<br><br>**All references to &quot;Brawl Stars&quot; in the application title and description are intended solely to promote the application to potential users. It does not aim to violate any trademark.**<br><br>Our application is created for Brawl Stars fans to complete coloring pages and collect pictures to the extent permitted by the fan content policy.<br>This material is unofficial and is not endorsed by Supercell. For more information, see Supercell&#39;s Fan Content Policy: www.supercell.com/fan-content-policy.",
